     The rrppcc..rrwwaalllldd utility is a server which will send a message to users
     currently logged in to the system.  This server invokes the wall(1) com‐
     mand to actually write the messages to the system.

     The following option is available:

     --nn      Do not become a daemon.  This option is only available when
             rrppcc..rrwwaalllldd is not invoked by inetd(8).

     Messages are sent to this server by the rwall(1) command.  The rrppcc..rrwwaalllldd
     daemon is normally invoked by inetd(8).

